---RAM* program---
PC=10
 2: +000         COUNT-UP Program:                                            
 3: +000         Outputs the positive integers,                               
 4: +000         in order, beginning with 1.                                  
 5: +000 -                                                                    
 6: +000         (Demonstrates the Unconditional Jump instruction, 7)         
 7: +000 -                                                                    
 8: +000         PC starts at cell  10.                                       
 9: +000 -                                                                    
10: +200         Clear ACC & add contents of cell 00.                         
11: +309         Store contents of ACC in cell 09. <---|                      
12: +109         Output contents of cell 09.           | = loop               
13: +400         Add contents of cell 00 to ACC.       |                      
14: +711         Jump to cell 11.   -------------------|                      
15: +000 -                                                                    
16: +000 -                                                                    
17: +000         (For Conditional Jump instruction 8, see COUNTDN.RAM)        
